            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/29#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/41#4"
          ],
          "note": "Our sun is a sub-Logos (29.1, 29.5); all stars are part of the same Logos (29.4); hierarchical relation of sub-Logos to Logos (41.4)"
